{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320","id":5098934704,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABL-uRsA","number":320,"title":"90 records whose CAS-RN is registered in ChEBI against a different term than their CURIE","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-08-08T18:45:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T19:53:09Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T19:53:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## The check\n\nFor every record carrying both a `cas_rn` and a CHEBI `ontology_id`, ask which\nCHEBI term ChEBI itself registers that CAS against:\n\n```\nCAS -> CHEBI index from chebi.db (oio:hasDbXref, 29,736 CAS numbers)\n\nrecords with CAS + CHEBI id        1370\n  CAS registered on THIS term      1074\n  CAS not in ChEBI at all           206\n  CAS registered on a DIFFERENT term  90   <- defect candidates\n```\n\n**This class is invisible to InChIKey comparison**, which is why it survived the\nCAS-vs-structure checking done so far: the mis-mapped term is usually a\nparent/grouping class with no structure at all, so there is no key to compare.\nThe failure mode is a name lookup landing on a parent while the CAS points at\nthe specific child.\n\n## Cross-validation\n\nThe check independently rediscovers four defects found separately, one at a time,\nby the research lane — before this query existed:\n\n| record | CURIE | CAS points to |\n|---|---|---|\n| `Ca-pantothenate` | CHEBI:29032 `(R)-pantothenate` | **CHEBI:31345 Calcium pantothenate** (the #315 merge) |\n| `02_Thiamine_Pyrophosphate` | CHEBI:9532 | CHEBI:18290 `…diphosphate chloride` |\n| `Bicine` | CHEBI:39065 (structureless class) | CHEBI:40957 `N,N-bis(2-hydroxyethyl)glycine` |\n| `Aluminium sulfate` | CHEBI:74772 (class) | CHEBI:74768 `aluminium sulfate (anhydrous)` |\n| `Bisabolene` | CHEBI:49235 (family class) | CHEBI:49240 `alpha-bisabolene` |\n\nFour separate agents reaching five of these independently, and a mechanical query\nreproducing all of them, is good evidence the remaining 85 are real.\n\n## Two sub-classes, different remedies — do not mass-apply\n\n**(a) CURIE is a parent; the label names the specific child.** Fix the CURIE.\n`Bicine` (a structureless grouping class with a disjunctive definition),\n`Bisabolene` (family over 16 terms — note `C15H24` is shared by all of them, so\na formula check passes on the wrong term), `Ca-pantothenate`, `Aluminium sulfate`,\n`alpha-Lactose` → `Alpha-lactose monohydrate`, `Carboxymethyl cellulose` →\n`carboxymethylcellulose sodium`.\n\n**(b) CURIE is correctly generic for a generic label; the *CAS* is over-specific.**\nFix or drop the CAS, not the mapping. `Arginine` (CHEBI:29016, stereo-agnostic —\ncorrect for a bare label) whose CAS 74-79-3 is L-arginine's; `Ascorbic acid`\n(CHEBI:22652) with L-ascorbic acid's CAS; `D-Ribose` with D-ribofuranose's.\n\nSub-class (b) is the same shape as the bare-anion convention in #319: a\ndeliberately generic term is right for a generic label, and it is the\n*over-specific companion field* that is wrong. Getting this backwards would\nbreak correct records.\n\n## Suggested action\n\nTriage the 90 into (a) and (b); the discriminator is whether the record's own\nlabel is generic or specific. Then add the query as a standing check — it is\ncheap, needs only `chebi.db`, and catches a class nothing else does.\n\nAlso worth noting the 206 \"CAS not in ChEBI at all\": not a defect by itself, but\nit is the population where a wrong CAS can hide indefinitely, since neither this\ncheck nor an InChIKey comparison can adjudicate it.\n\n## Provenance\n\nProposed by the Claude research lane after it hit the same shape three times\n(`Bicine`, `Bisabolene`, `02_Thiamine_Pyrophosphate`) and observed that InChIKey\ncomparison structurally cannot catch it. Verified repo-wide against chebi.db.\nRelated: #315, #316, #317, #319.","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/320/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}